LICENSE ACCEPTANCE AND DISPUTE RESOLUTION

By using, copying, modifying, or distributing the Project, you automatically accept the terms of this License. If you do not agree with them, you may not exercise the rights granted by the License.

In the event of violations of the terms of this License by third parties (such as plagiarism, unlawful concealment of the creator's name, or unauthorized closing of the Source Code), the Author reserves the right to protect their interests through official mechanisms of software hosting platforms. This includes submitting official complaints to moderators and administrators of GitHub, GitLab, XDA Developers, as well as using international DMCA procedures.

